		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Undulating mass of tendrils, mouths, eyes, and meaty nodules. Quivers, pulsates, and reshapes itself constantly.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 13, <strong>HP</strong> 37, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 tendrils (near) +6 (1d6 + instability), <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +1, <strong>D</strong> +1, <strong>C</strong> +1, <strong>I</strong> +0, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> +0, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 8</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Instability</strong>. Target's body dribbles and runs like wax. CON 15+ or permanently lose 1 WIS. Repeat check once per round; ends on success. Lose cohesiveness, turn into ochre jelly at 0 WIS.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
